{"id":"word:hebrew:H8010","type":"word","title":"שְׁלֹמֹה","subtitle":"H8010 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Shelomah , David's successor","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שְׁלֹמֹה (H8010) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 293 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שְׁלֹמֹה (Shᵉlômôh) means Shelomah , David's successor First listed occurrence: 1Chr 3 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שְׁלֹמֹה","transliteration":"Shᵉlômôh","pronunciation":"shel-o-mo'","strong":"H8010","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8010","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["שְׁלֹמֹ֔ה","שְׁלֹמֹ֖ה","שְׁלֹמֹה֙","שְׁלֹמֹ֑ה","שְׁלֹמֹֽה"],"morphs":[["HNp",242],["HR/Np",38],["HC/Np",7],["HC/R/Np",5],["HTr/R/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Shelomah , David's successor","usage":"Solomon.","full":"H8010. Shelomoh שְׁלֹמִה 293 proper name, masculine Solomon ( Σαλωμων , rarely Σαλομων , ᵐ5 L mostly Σολομων ; compare Lag BN 53 96 ); — king of Israel, son of David and Bathsheba 2Sam 12:24 ; 1Kin 1:11 + [name 2 t. Samuel; 162 t. Kings; 109 t. Chronicles; 7 t. Ezra Nehemiah]; born in Jerusalem 2Sam 5:14 ; 1Chr 3:5 ; 14:4 ; designated by David as successor, anointed and proclaimed before David's death 1Kin 1:30 , 33 , 34 , 39 +; king after David's death 2:12 , 17 ; 1Chr 29:28 ; 2Chr 1:1 + [phrase שׁ ׳הַמֶּלָךְ 1Kin 1:34 36 t. Kings, 11 t. Chronicles, Jer 52:20 ; Song 3:9 , 11 ; ׳שׁ ׳הַמּ 1Kin 2:17 ; 12:2 ; 1Chr 29:24 ; 2Chr 10:2 ; ׳שׁ יְהוּדָה מֶלֶךְ 1Kin 12:23 ; 2Chr 11:3 , ׳מ ׳יִשׂ 2Kin 23:13 ; 24:13 ; 2Chr 30:26 ; 35:3 ; Neh 13:26 ]; builder of temple 1 Kings 5:22; 1Kin 6:1-2 , 1Chr 5:26 + often; wise 1Kin 3:10 ; 5:9 ; 5:10 ; 5:14 ; 10:1-2 , 3 , 4 ; 2Chr 1:7 , 11 +; author of proverbs (and songs) according to Proverbs שׁ ׳מִשְׁלֵי 1:1 ; 10:1 ; 25:1 (compare 1Kin 5:12 ; 5:13 ), see also ׳לִשׁ Psa 72:1 ; 127:1 (titles), Song 1:1 (title); of written provision for priests, etc. 2Chr 35:4 , compare 8:14 ; Neh 12:45 ; elsewhere (outside of Kings, Chronicles) name occurs Jer 52:20 ; Song 1:5 (Wkl Altor. Forsch. ii. 196. proposes Šalmaites , Nabataean שלמו Lzb 376 , compare Levy Tw ii. 489 Jastr 1587 ), 3:7 , 9 , 11 ; 8:11-12 , and in phrase ׳שׁ עַבְדֵי בְּנֵי Ezra 2:55 , 58 = Neh 7:57 , 60 ; 11:3 .","rootNote":"from 7965 ; peaceful ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 3 5","keyReferences":["1Chr 3 5","1Chr 3 10","1Chr 5 36","1Chr 6 17","1Chr 14 4","1Chr 18 8","1Chr 22 5","1Chr 22 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":293,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 3 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁלֹמֹה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹמֹ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 36","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹמֹ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹמֹ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁלֹמֹֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹמֹ֗ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁלֹמֹ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/שְׁלֹמֹ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/שְׁלֹמֹ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":9,"e